# TurnUp mobile (Expo)

Copy this file to `mobile/.env` and fill in values from the root `.env.local` / Clerk dashboard.

# Same Clerk application as the web app
EXPO_PUBLIC_CLERK_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=""

# Next.js backend URL
# - iOS simulator / Android emulator: http://localhost:3000
# - Physical device: http://<your-computer-lan-ip>:3000
EXPO_PUBLIC_API_URL="http://localhost:3000"
